flowchart LR
    Browser[Browser / React UI] -->|HTTPS request + cookie| API[Application API]
    API -->|query constrained by user/tenant| DB[(Database)]
    API -->|session lookup / revoke| Store[(Session Store)]
    API -->|authorization code / OIDC protocol| IdP[Identity Provider]
    API --> Logs[Redacted Audit / Security Logs]
    Browser -. untrusted input .-> API
    Browser -. client state is not authority .-> API
    DB -. sensitive data boundary .-> API
    Store -. session IDs must not be logged .-> API
